@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam dpi 100
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #000000
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
  BorderColor #000000
}
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
  BorderColor #000000
}
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
  BorderColor #000000
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #000000
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #000000
}
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #000000
}
skinparam entity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #000000
}
title Online Bookstore: Component Overview
top to bottom direction
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 28
component "React SPA (AC-01)\nUI modules FM-01 to FM-11" as SPA
component "REST API Layer (AC-02)\nBM-15 Platform and Security:\nroutes, controllers, middleware" as APIL
rectangle "Business Service Layer (AC-03)" as SVC {
  component "Accounts and communication\nBM-01 Authentication\nBM-02 User and Profile\nBM-13 Notification" as G0
  component "Catalog and content\nBM-03 Catalog\nBM-05 Wishlist\nBM-08 Review\nBM-14 Media\nBM-16 Book Management" as G1
  component "Purchase\nBM-04 Cart\nBM-06 Order\nBM-07 Payment\nBM-10 Inventory" as G2
  component "Seller and administration\nBM-09 Seller\nBM-11 Admin\nBM-12 Reporting" as G3
}
rectangle "Data Access Layer (AC-04)\nrepositories and Mongoose models" as DAL
database "MongoDB (AC-05)" as DB
component "Payment Adapter (AC-06)" as PAD
component "Email Adapter (AC-07)" as EAD
cloud "Payment Gateway\n(external)" as PG
cloud "Email Service\n(external)" as ES
cloud "Uptime monitor\n(external)" as UM
SPA -down-> APIL : HTTPS, JSON (I-01)
UM -down-> APIL : GET /api/health (I-26)
APIL -down-> SVC : I-02
G1 ..> G2
G2 ..> G0
G2 ..> G1
G3 ..> G0
G3 ..> G1
G3 ..> G2
SVC -down-> DAL
DAL -down-> DB
G2 -right-> PAD : I-11
G0 -left-> EAD : I-12
PAD -down-> PG : HTTPS
EAD -down-> ES : SMTP or HTTPS
PG .up.> APIL : I-25 webhook
legend bottom
I-01 browser to API (HTTPS, JSON)   I-02 controllers to services   I-03 services to repositories
I-11 BM-07 to payment adapter   I-12 BM-13 to email adapter   I-25 gateway webhook   I-26 health check
Every module also uses BM-15 (not drawn). Dependencies between single modules are in the next diagram.
endlegend
@enduml
